WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:02.330
- I do not deserve an
angel like you in my life.

00:00:02.330 --> 00:00:04.048
- How do I know you're
telling me the truth?

00:00:04.048 --> 00:00:05.641
(dramatic music)

00:00:05.641 --> 00:00:08.700
(bell dinging)

00:00:08.700 --> 00:00:10.396
(bell dinging)

00:00:10.396 --> 00:00:11.601
(bell dinging)

00:00:11.601 --> 00:00:12.471
- Hello!

00:00:12.471 --> 00:00:13.560
I didn't get your name the other day.

00:00:13.560 --> 00:00:14.920
- Beth, hi.
- Hey, beautiful.

00:00:14.920 --> 00:00:15.870
- Vincent, please.

00:00:15.870 --> 00:00:17.773
- He's not hitting on me!

00:00:18.920 --> 00:00:21.173
- You are incredible.

00:00:22.097 --> 00:00:23.729
(giggling)

00:00:23.729 --> 00:00:25.356
- I adore her.

00:00:25.356 --> 00:00:26.519
(somber music)

00:00:26.519 --> 00:00:29.102
(bell dinging)

00:00:32.900 --> 00:00:34.150
- I can explain.

00:00:34.150 --> 00:00:35.533
- So I'm free to go then?

00:00:37.630 --> 00:00:39.270
- Why?

00:00:39.270 --> 00:00:40.103
- Why not?

00:00:40.103 --> 00:00:42.193
- We're just going through a rough patch.

00:00:43.560 --> 00:00:44.780
- I came to say sorry.

00:00:44.780 --> 00:00:47.570
- No, that's not true.

00:00:47.570 --> 00:00:49.961
- I'm so sorry, babe, I lost my way.

00:00:49.961 --> 00:00:52.481
I can't do any of it without you.

00:00:52.481 --> 00:00:53.314
(somber music)

00:00:53.314 --> 00:00:55.897
(bell dinging)

00:00:56.995 --> 00:00:58.887
(bell dinging)

00:00:58.887 --> 00:01:01.470
(somber music)

